  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 715.07 Compliance Determination. The department shall determine compliance with the requirements of Env-Dw 715.06 by a PWS subject to this part as specified in 40 CFR § 141.133.\n\nSource. #9619, eff 1-1-10; ss by #12532, eff 6-1-18",
